 "intro_html": "Malai means cream. This is Swasthi’s reshmi (malai) kabab: creamy, mild and not strongly spiced, with a little char from a very hot oven. The marinade is thickened with <b>ground almonds and cashews</b>, the way she makes it when she has no almond meal. It’s served with mint chutney. Double everything for a main course.",
